# The inherited starvation bug, as a gate: one loud camera fills a shared queue and the
# next arrival must evict the LOUD camera's own oldest item, never the quiet one's.
scenario fair_eviction
records_min 16

queue fair
capacity 4
overflow drop_oldest
max_batch_size 4
max_delay_us 0

put cam_loud
put cam_loud
put cam_loud
put cam_quiet
# Full. The victim is the greediest lane's oldest item, not the queue's oldest item --
# which would be cam_loud's first either way, so the second overflow is the real test.
put cam_loud
put cam_loud
# Whatever is left, in the order the queue chooses to serve it.
take
close
